    "Scan of the 1974 edition of the Apex, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1984; field checked in 1974; photo inspected in 1988; photo revised in 1987; last revised in 1987; printed in 1992.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
